<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAL" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Malachie</para>
  <para style="toc1">MALACHIE</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malachie</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mal</para>
  <para style="mt1">MALACHIE</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 1:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:1">És 13:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Revelasyon pawòl SENYÈ a bay Israël pa Malachie.<verse eid="MAL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 1:2" />“Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:37">Det 4:37</ref></char></note>renmen nou,” pale SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 1:2">Men ou di: “Nan kisa ou te renmen nou an?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAL 1:2">“Se pa Ésaü ki te frè Jacob?” deklare SENYÈ a. “Men se Jacob Mwen te renmen; <verse eid="MAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 1:3" />men Mwen te rayi Ésaü. Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:10">Jr 49:10</ref>,<ref loc="JER 49:16-18">16-18</ref></char></note>fè mòn li yo vin yon kote dezole, e Mwen te livre eritaj li bay chen mawon dezè yo.” <verse eid="MAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 1:4" />Tandiske Edom di: “Yo fin bat nou nèt, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:17">Jr 5:17</ref> </char></note>men nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:9">És 9:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 9:10">10</ref></char></note>retounen vin bati sou ranblè yo;” konsa pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo: “Yo va bati, men mwen va jete; konsa, moun va rele yo peyi mechan an, e pèp sou sila SENYÈ a fache pou tout tan an.”<verse eid="MAL 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 1:5" />Zye nou va wè sa e nou va di: “SENYÈ a gran, menm pi lwen lizyè Israël la!”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:27">Sòm 35:27</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 1:6" />“Yon fis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Egz 20:12</ref> </char></note>onore papa li, e yon sèvitè onore mèt li. Alò, si Mwen se yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:31">Det 1:31</ref> </char></note>papa, kote onè pa M nan? Epi si Mwen se yon mèt, kote respè M nan?” pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo a prèt yo ki meprize non Mwen an. “Men nou di: ‘Nan kisa nou te meprize non Ou an?’ <verse eid="MAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 1:7" />N ap ofri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 3:11">Lev 3:11</ref></char></note>pen ki souye sou lotèl Mwen an. Men nou di: ‘Nan kisa nou te souye Ou a?’ Nan sa, n ap di: ‘Tab SENYÈ a meprizab.’ <verse eid="MAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 1:8" />Lè nou ofri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:18">Jr 27:18</ref></char></note> bèt avèg kon sakrifis la, èske sa pa yon mal? Epi lè nou ofri bèt ki bwate, e ki malad la, èske sa pa yon mal? Poukisa nou pa ofri sa yo bay gwo chèf peyi a? Èske l ap kontan avèk nou? Oswa, èske se ak dousè ak kè kontan ke l ap aksepte nou?” pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo.<verse eid="MAL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 1:9" />Men koulye a, chèche mande favè Bondye, pou Li kapab beni nou? Ak yon ofrann konsa, èske L ap aksepte okenn nan nou ak dousè? mande SENYÈ Dèzame yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:18">Jr 27:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 1:10" />O ke te genyen youn nan nou pou ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:13">És 1:13</ref></char></note>fèmen pòt yo, pou nou pa ta chofe dife pou granmèsi sou lotèl Mwen an! “Mwen pa kontan avèk nou”, pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo. “Ofrann nan k ap sòti nan men nou, Mwen p ap aksepte l nonpli. <verse eid="MAL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 1:11" />Paske depi solèy la leve jis rive kote li kouche a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 111:9">Sòm 111:9</ref></char></note>non Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:18">És 66:18</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 66:19">19</ref> </char></note>gran pami nasyon yo, e tout kote, lansan ak ofrann sereyal ki san tach va vin ofri a non Mwen. Paske non Mwen va gran pami nasyon yo,” pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo. <verse eid="MAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 1:12" />“Men nou ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:7">Mal 1:7</ref></char></note>pwofane li lè nou di: ‘Tab SENYÈ a vin souye, fwi li, menm manje li vin meprizab.’ <verse eid="MAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 1:13" />Nou di tou: ‘Gade, a la fatigan sa fatigan!’ Nou pa vle menm pran sant li,” pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo. “Konsa, nou te pote sa ke yo te pran nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:4">Lev 6:4</ref> </char></note>vyolans, sa ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:8">Mal 1:8</ref></char></note>bwate ak sa ki te malad. Konsa menm, nou pote ofrann nan! Èske se sa ke Mwen ta dwe aksepte nan men nou an?” pale SENYÈ a.<verse eid="MAL 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 1:14" />“Men malè pou sila k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:1-4">Trav 5:1-4</ref> </char></note>twonpe a, ki gen nan bann mouton li an, yon mal, ki fè sèman pou livre li, men ki anfen, fè sakrifis bay SENYÈ a ak yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:18-20">Lev 22:18-20</ref></char></note>bèt ki gen defo. Paske Mwen se yon gwo Wa,” pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo, “e non Mwen etonnan pami nasyon yo.”<verse eid="MAL 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 2:1" />“Alò, koulye a, prèt yo, lòd sa a se pou nou. <verse eid="MAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 2:2" />Si nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:14">Lev 26:14</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 26:15">15</ref></char></note>pa koute e si nou pa pran sa a kè pou bay lonè a non Mwen”, pale SENYÈ dèzame yo, “alò, Mwen va voye malediksyon sou nou, e Mwen va fè benediksyon nou yo vin tounen malediksyon. Anverite, Mwen fin modi yo deja, akoz nou pa pran sa a kè. <verse eid="MAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 2:3" />Gade byen, Mwen va fè repwòch nou rive jis sou desandan nou yo, e Mwen va gaye poupou sou figi nou, menm poupou a festen nou yo; epi nou va vin disparèt ansanm avè l.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:16">Lev 26:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 2:4" />Konsa, nou va konnen ke Mwen te voye lòd sa a bannou, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:11-13">Nonb 3:11-13</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 3:45">45</ref></char></note>akò Mwen an kapab kontinye ak Lévi”, pale SENYÈ dèzame yo. <verse eid="MAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 2:5" />“Akò Mwen an avèk li se te akò pou lavi ak lapè. Mwen te bay li yo pou li ta kab vin gen lakrent anvè M; epi konsa, li te krent Mwen e te vin gen gwo lakrent pou non Mwen.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:7">Nonb 25:7</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 25:8">8</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 25:13">13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 2:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 119:142">Sòm 119:142</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 119:151">151</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 119:160">160</ref></char></note>Lalwa verite a te nan bouch li, e inikite pa t janm sou lèv li. Li te mache avè M nan lapè ak ladwati, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:22">Jr 23:22</ref> </char></note>detounen anpil moun soti nan inikite. <verse eid="MAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 2:7" />Paske lèv a yon prèt dwe gade <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:11">Lev 10:11</ref></char></note>konesans, e moun ta dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:21">Nonb 27:21</ref> </char></note>chache lalwa soti nan bouch li. Paske li se mesaje a SENYÈ dèzame yo. <verse eid="MAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 2:8" />Men pou nou menm, nou te detounen kite chemen an. Nou te koze anpil moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:15">Jr 18:15</ref></char></note>chite nan lalwa a. Nou te dezonore akò Lévi a,” pale SENYÈ dèzame yo. <verse eid="MAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 2:9" />“Akoz sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NAM 3:6">Na 3:6</ref></char></note>Mwen te fè nou vin meprizab tou, e vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:26">Éz 7:26</ref> </char></note>imilye devan tout pèp la, akoz nou pa t gade chemen Mwen yo, men nou te nan patipri nan lalwa a. <verse eid="MAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 2:10" />Èske se pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:16">És 63:16</ref></char></note>yon sèl papa nou genyen? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:24">Trav 17:24</ref> </char></note>Èske se pa yon sèl Bondye a ki te kreye nou? Poukisa nou chak ap trayi pwòp frè nou, nan pwofane akò a papa zansèt nou yo? <verse eid="MAL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 2:11" />Juda te aji nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:7-9">Jr 3:7-9</ref></char></note>enfidelite, e yon abominasyon te fèt an Israël ak Jérusalem; paske Juda te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:1">Esd 9:1</ref>,<ref loc="EZR 9:2">2</ref> </char></note>pwofane sanktyè a SENYÈ a, ke li renmen, e te vin marye ak fi a yon dye etranje. <verse eid="MAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 2:12" />SENYÈ a va koupe retire nonm nan ki fè sa a, sila ki leve e sila ki reponn nan, soti nan tant a Jacob yo, oswa sila ki prezante ofrann a SENYÈ Dèzame yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 11:14">Jr 11:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAL 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 2:13" />“Men yon lòt bagay nou fè: nou kouvri lotèl SENYÈ a ak dlo k ap sòti nan zye nou, nan kriye ak plenyen, akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 11:14">Jr 11:14</ref></char></note>Li pa konsidere ofrann yo ankò, ni aksepte yo ak favè ki soti nan men nou. <verse eid="MAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 2:14" />Malgre sa, nou di: ‘Pou ki rezon?’ Paske SENYÈ a te yon temwen antre nou menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:6">És 54:6</ref></char></note>ak madanm jenès nou an, kont sila nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:2">Jr 9:2</ref> </char></note>aji an trèt la, malgre li se konpanyen e madanm nou selon akò nou an. <verse eid="MAL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 2:15" />Éske Li pa t fè nou youn sèl? Malgre, se te li ki te gen retay Lespri a. Pouki sa youn sèl? Li t ap chache <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:12">Rt 4:12</ref></char></note>desandan ladwati a. Alò, veye lespri nou byen ke pèsòn pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Egz 20:14</ref> </char></note>aji an trèt kont madanm jenès li a. <verse eid="MAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 2:16" />Youn ki rayi epi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1">Det 24:1</ref></char></note>divòse”, pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, “kouvri vètman li ak vyolans lan,” pale SENYÈ a. “Pou sa, veye lespri nou byen, ke nou pa enfidèl.<verse eid="MAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 2:17" />“Nou te fatige SENYÈ a ak pawòl nou yo. Malgre sa, nou di: ‘Nan kisa nou te fatige Li a?’ Paske n ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:20">És 5:20</ref></char></note>‘Tout moun k ap fè mal, bon nan zye SENYÈ a, e Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:24">Job 9:24</ref> </char></note>pran plezi nan yo;’ oswa ‘Kote Bondye jistis la ye?’”<verse eid="MAL 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 3:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:10">Mat 11:10</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 11:14">14</ref></char>
    </note>“Gade byen, Mwen va voye mesaje Mwen an, e li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">És 40:3</ref> </char></note>netwaye chemen an devan Mwen. Konsa, Senyè a, ke n ap chache a, va vini sibitman nan tanp Li an. Gade byen, mesaje akò a, nan sila nou pran plezi a, L ap vini,” pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo. <verse eid="MAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 3:2" />“Men se kilès k ap ka <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 33:14">És 33:14</ref></char></note>sipòte jou vini Li an? Oswa, se kilès k ap ka kanpe lè Li parèt la? Paske se va tankou dife nan founo a, e se va tankou savon lesiv. <verse eid="MAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 3:3" />Li va chita tankou yon bòs metal k ap pirifye ajan. Li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:25">És 1:25</ref></char></note>pirifye fis a Levi yo, e rafine yo tankou lò ak ajan, pou yo ka ofri bay SENYÈ a ofrann ladwati. <verse eid="MAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 3:4" />Konsa, ofrann Juda ak Jérusalem yo va yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:17-19">Sòm 51:17-19</ref></char></note>plezi pou SENYÈ a, tankou nan jou ansyen ak jou lontan yo.<verse eid="MAL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 3:5" />“Konsa, Mwen va vin kote nou pou jijman. Mwen va fè temwen byen rapid kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:10">Det 18:10</ref></char></note>wangatè yo, kont moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:9-11">Éz 22:9-11</ref> </char></note>adiltè yo, ak kont sila k ap fè fo temwayaj yo; kont sila k ap oprime ouvriye yo nan salè yo, vèv yo, òfelen yo, sila ki refize bay soutyen yo a etranje yo, ak sila ki pa gen lakrent Mwen yo,” pale SENYÈ, dèzame yo.<verse eid="MAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 3:6" />“Paske Mwen menm SENYÈ a, Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:19">Nonb 23:19</ref></char></note>pa chanje. Se pou sa, nou menm, O fis a Jacob yo, nou pa t fin detwi nèt. <verse eid="MAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 3:7" />Depi nan jou a papa zansèt nou yo, nou te vire kite règleman Mwen yo, e nou pa t kenbe yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:3">Za 1:3</ref></char></note>Retounen vin jwenn Mwen, e Mwen va retounen vin jwenn nou,” pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo. “Men nou di: ‘Nan kisa nou va retounen vin jwenn Ou an?’<verse eid="MAL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 3:8" />“Èske yon nonm va vòlè Bondye? Men nou ap vòlè M! Men nou di: ‘Nan kisa nou te vòlè Ou a?’ Nan dim ak ofrann yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:11">Né 13:11</ref>,<ref loc="NEH 13:12">12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 3:9" />Nou vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 2:2">Mal 2:2</ref></char></note>modi avèk malediksyon an;. Paske nou ap vòlè Mwen; tout nasyon an nèt! <verse eid="MAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 3:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lev 27:30</ref></char></note>Mennen fè antre tout dim yo nan depo kay la, pou ka gen manje nan kay Mwen an, e pase Mwen a leprèv nan sa”, pale SENYÈ a: “Pou nou wè si Mwen p ap louvri pou nou tout fenèt syèl yo, e vide sou nou yon benediksyon jiskaske nou pa gen ase kote ankò pou nou resevwa li. <verse eid="MAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 3:11" />Nan lè sa a, Mwen va repwoche, pou nou menm, sila k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:4">Jl 1:4</ref></char></note>devore nou, pou li pa ankò detwi fwi latè yo. Konsa, pye rezen an p ap ankò jete fwi li avan lè nan chan an”, pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo. <verse eid="MAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 3:12" />“Tout nasyon yo va rele nou beni, paske nou va yon peyi byen bèl”, pale SENYÈ dèzame yo.<verse eid="MAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 3:13" />“Pawòl nou yo te di kont mwen.” Pale SENYÈ a. “Malgre sa, nou di: ‘Kisa nou te pale kont Ou yo?’ <verse eid="MAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 3:14" />“Nou te di: ‘Se an ven yo sèvi Bondye’; epi ‘Ki avantaj sa gen pou nou kenbe règleman Li yo, e pou nou mache lamante devan SENYÈ Dèzame yo?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 58:3">És 58:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 3:15" />Koulye a, nou vin rele moun ògeye yo, ‘beni’. Non sèlman malfektè yo vin leve wo, men yo menm tante Bondye, e yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:10">Jr 7:10</ref></char></note>chape.’”<verse eid="MAL 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 3:16" />Answit, sila ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:15">Sòm 34:15</ref></char></note>gen lakrent SENYÈ yo te pale a youn lòt; konsa, SENYÈ a te prete zòrèy Li. Li te tande yo, e yon liv souvni te ekri devan Li pou sila ki te gen lakrent SENYÈ yo, e ki te bay gwo respè a non Li yo. <verse eid="MAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 3:17" />“Konsa, yo va vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:1">És 43:1</ref> </char></note>pou Mwen”, pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo, “nan jou sa a ke M prepare posesyon Mwen an. Epi Mwen va fè yo gras menm jan yon nonm ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 103:13">Sòm 103:13</ref></char></note>fè gras a pwòp fis k ap sèvi li a.” <verse eid="MAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAL 3:18" />Konsa, nou va retounen pou nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:25">Jen 18:25</ref></char></note> byen konprann diferans la antre ladwati ak mal, antre sila k ap sèvi Bondye, ak sila ki p ap sèvi Li.<verse eid="MAL 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 4:1" />“Paske gade byen, jou a ap vini, byen cho tankou yon founo, lè tout moun ògeye yo ak tout malfektè yo va vin tounen pay vannen. Jou k ap vini an va fin boule yo nèt,” pale SENYÈ Dèzame yo: “jiskaske li pa kite pou yo ni rasin ni branch.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 21:9">Sòm 21:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:18">És 9:18</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 9:19">19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 4:2" />Men pou nou menm ki gen lakrent non Mwen an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 23:4">II Sam 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:17">Jr 30:17</ref> </char></note>solèy ladwati a va vin leve ak gerizon nan zèl li. Konsa, nou va sòti deyò pou sote toupatou tankou ti bèf ki fenk sòti nan pak yo. <verse eid="MAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 4:3" />Nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 40:12">Job 40:12</ref></char></note>foule mechan an anba pye nou, paske yo va tankou sann anba pla pye nou nan jou ke Mwen fè,” pale SENYÈ dèzame yo.<verse eid="MAL 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 4:4" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:23">Det 4:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Sonje lalwa a sèvitè Mwen an, Moïse, règleman ak òdonans ke M te kòmande li nan Horeb pou tout Israël yo.<verse eid="MAL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 4:5" />“Gade byen, Mwen ap voye bannou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mat 11:14</ref></char></note>Élie, pwofèt la, avan gwo jou tèrib a SENYÈ a vin rive a. <verse eid="MAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 4:6" />Li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:17">Luc 1:17</ref></char></note>tounen kè a papa yo vè pitit yo, e kè a pitit yo vè papa yo, pou m pa vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:4">És 11:4</ref> </char></note>frape peyi a avèk yon malediksyon.”<verse eid="MAL 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 4" />
</usx>